cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below. (Working title — pending confirmation by the dataset owner; not yet publicly released.)"
title: "MastersDivination Benchmark"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-29"
authors:
  - name: "MastersDivination Benchmark Working Group"
abstract: >-
  A method-agnostic benchmark of historical master divination cases.
  Each case provides the subject and the situation known at the time,
  plus the recorded predictions of recognized masters (any tradition)
  and the recorded outcome. Systems are scored only on agreement with
  the masters' results: conclusion direction, key specific assertions,
  and outcome alignment. The benchmark measures agreement with master
  readings; it does not claim to measure supernatural accuracy.
keywords:
  - divination
  - benchmark
  - I Ching
  - history of astrology
  - evaluation
license: "Mixed — per-record license_status and redistributable fields govern reuse"
